That is what I and you already know

575
00:49:29,121 --> 00:49:33,095
that a people would not walk out of their kingdom

576
00:49:33,580 --> 00:49:36,224
and give up their sovereignty without a fight.

577
00:49:37,317 --> 00:49:40,532
We are occupying their land. What do you think you want them just walk out?

578
00:49:41,163 --> 00:49:44,370
He said: It's expected that they will mobilize their soldiers to fight us.

579
00:49:45,366 --> 00:49:47,600
So, Abu Bakr(ابوبكر) is saying was so new about it.

580
00:49:50,905 --> 00:49:52,266
This is something that is expected.

581
00:49:52,325 --> 00:49:56,482
مَا كَانَ قَوْمٌ لِّيَخْرُجُ مِنْ مُلْكِ مُعَيْدَه’سُلْطَانَه’ بِغَيْرِ قِتَالْ

582
00:49:57,436 --> 00:50:01,220
People are not going to hand over their sovereignty and their kingdom and their land

583
00:50:01,452 --> 00:50:03,616
and we talked about the jewels of the Roman Empire

584
00:50:03,967 --> 00:50:06,510
Syria and Jerusalem, the holy city, the Holy Land.

585
00:50:07,116 --> 00:50:09,157
What do you think that they just hand it over for you?

586
00:50:10,712 --> 00:50:14,098
They're not going to give it, except if you fight them.

587
00:50:15,681 --> 00:50:25,744
So, now he has given a Sakeena(سكينة) to Abu Obaidah(ابوعبيدة) and then he said;

588
00:50:26,832 --> 00:50:32,718
And I don't want you to look forward to receiving any reinforcements from me

589
00:50:34,092 --> 00:50:36,341
and I want you to depend on Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ

590
00:50:36,366 --> 00:50:39,024
and then on the soldiers that you have under your leadership.

591
00:50:40,529 --> 00:50:42,342
Don't keep asking for reinforcements.

592
00:50:43,032 --> 00:50:45,333
Depends on Allah and the soldiers that you have,

593
00:50:47,182 --> 00:50:51,870
at the end of the letter, he writes one line. He said:

594
00:50:53,057 --> 00:50:58,577
And even then I am going to send you men until, you will ask for no more.

595
00:50:59,684 --> 00:51:02,482
I'm going to help you but I just want to make a point

596
00:51:03,894 --> 00:51:08,229
 first of all what you're saying, should be seen as good news be optimistic.

597
00:51:08,510 --> 00:51:12,729
Number two you should depend on Allah not depend on reinforcements.

598
00:51:13,854 --> 00:51:17,029
However, I'm going to give you reinforcement, I'm gonna send you reinforcement.

599
00:51:18,356 --> 00:51:25,055
So, the Roman Emperor moved into Syria.

600
00:51:25,598 --> 00:51:26,998
When Jerusalem fell,

601
00:51:29,499 --> 00:51:35,981
Roman Emperor packed up his belongings and left and he said;

602
00:51:36,725 --> 00:51:38,315
وَدَاعًا يَا سُوْرِيَا

603
00:51:39,297 --> 00:51:43,646
Farewell to Syria, we will never meet again.

604
00:51:46,972 --> 00:51:48,448
And he left

605
00:51:50,428 --> 00:51:57,269
and he was talking to one of his soldiers who was captured by the Muslims, a POW.

606
00:51:58,100 --> 00:52:01,954
He said, Tell me about these Muslims. He said;

607
00:52:03,403 --> 00:52:07,384
I've lived with them, and I saw them with my own eyes.

608
00:52:09,638 --> 00:52:16,862
اِنَّهُمْ فُرْسَانْ بِنَّهَارْ رُهْبَانْ بِلَّيْلِ

609
00:52:18,187 --> 00:52:22,060
I've lived among them and I saw them with my own eyes

610
00:52:22,570 --> 00:52:28,300
the Muslims are Knights during the day and monks during the night.

611
00:52:30,096 --> 00:52:33,338
During the day they're carrying their weapons fighting Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله)

612
00:52:33,580 --> 00:52:36,972
and at night they're standing in front of Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ praying.

613
00:52:38,528 --> 00:52:42,781
They turned into monks at night and they turn into fighters in the day

614
00:52:43,708 --> 00:52:47,118
that was the way of the early Muslims رضي الله عنهم.

615
00:52:56,707 --> 00:53:02,094
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب), he went to visit Abu Obaidah Amr Bin Jarrah(أبوعبيدةعمروبن جراح).

616
00:53:02,635 --> 00:53:05,903
So, they told Abu Obaidah(ابوعبيدة), Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) is outside and he wants to visit you.

617
00:53:05,979 --> 00:53:09,449
Abu Obaidah(ابوعبيدة) said: He wants nothing but to inspect my house

618
00:53:10,197 --> 00:53:11,982
 that's the only reason why is visiting me.

619
00:53:14,381 --> 00:53:18,549
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) came in, he sat with Abu Obaidah(ابوعبيدة) looked around

620
00:53:19,979 --> 00:53:21,727
and there was no furniture nothing,

621
00:53:23,229 --> 00:53:29,313
all what he saw, was a sword, a spear, a bow and arrows.

622
00:53:32,153 --> 00:53:34,804
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) said: Bring us some food.

623
00:53:36,101 --> 00:53:40,138
Abu Obaidah(ابوعبيدة) brought a basket that had pieces of dry bread in it.

624
00:53:41,211 --> 00:53:43,949
He said: This is our food.

625
00:53:44,941 --> 00:53:47,132
Umar Bin Khattab رضي الله عنه wept

626
00:53:47,845 --> 00:53:55,687
and he said: Duniyah(دُنِيَّا), this world has changed us all, except you Abu Obaidah(ابوعبيدة).

627
00:53:58,535 --> 00:54:02,029
Duniyah(دُنِيَّا) has taken a toll on every one of us,

628
00:54:02,493 --> 00:54:04,657
except for you Duniyah(دُنِيَّا) did not change you.

629
00:54:06,184 --> 00:54:09,016
And that's why Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) has so much trust in Abu Obaidah(ابوعبيدة),

630
00:54:09,367 --> 00:54:10,478
so much love for him

631
00:54:10,942 --> 00:54:12,942
because he was the Ameen(أمين) of this Ummah(امة),

632
00:54:13,719 --> 00:54:16,143
he was this trust worthy of this Ummah(امة).

633
00:54:16,481 --> 00:54:20,680
Rasool Allah ﷺ said: Abu Obaidah(ابوعبيدة) is the Ameen(أمين) of this Ummah(امة),

634
00:54:24,526 --> 00:54:26,651
anyone would change except Abu Obaidah(ابوعبيدة).

635
00:54:28,784 --> 00:54:30,980
Duniyah(دُنِيَّا) would affect everyone but about Abu Obaidah(ابوعبيدة)

636
00:54:32,971 --> 00:54:34,564
and that's why Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) said;

637
00:54:34,589 --> 00:54:37,197
When he asked the men with him to make a wish

638
00:54:37,924 --> 00:54:40,132
some of them said, we want this room full of gold,

639
00:54:40,156 --> 00:54:43,875
other said, we want this room full of pearls to spend it in the sake of Allah.

640
00:54:44,250 --> 00:54:48,884
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) said: I want this room to be filled of the likes of Abu Obaidah(ابوعبيدة).

641
00:54:48,939 --> 00:54:50,846
So, that I can send them Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله).

642
00:54:52,844 --> 00:54:55,119
That's the most valuable thing, I have.

643
00:54:55,317 --> 00:54:57,849
It is men like Abu Obaidah(ابوعبيدة) not my money,

644
00:54:58,322 --> 00:55:01,580
but men like Abu Obaidah Amr Bin Jarrah رضي الله عنه

645
00:55:01,697 --> 00:55:03,678
one of the 10 given the glad tidings Jannah(جنة).

646
00:55:11,216 --> 00:55:16,102
One incident worth mentioning is the Muslims opened the town of HIMS

647
00:55:18,046 --> 00:55:20,772
the people of HIMS surrendered, they agreed to pay the Jizya(جزية).

648
00:55:22,125 --> 00:55:24,315
The Romans were assembling the new army,

649
00:55:25,426 --> 00:55:30,949
See the Romans as Rasool Allah ﷺ said: They're not going to give up easily.

650
00:55:33,370 --> 00:55:39,588
As we mentioned last night, he says, the Persian Empire is one knock or two knocks,

651
00:55:39,613 --> 00:55:41,225
and then there's no Persian Empire.

652
00:55:42,018 --> 00:55:45,731
 But the Roman Empire, whenever you break a horn of them,

653
00:55:45,909 --> 00:55:48,045
another horn would grow in it's place,

654
00:55:48,724 --> 00:55:51,436
and they will carry on fighting you until the day of judgment.

655
00:55:52,060 --> 00:55:59,587
And they are people who can fight in mountains and on land and in sea,

656
00:56:00,532 --> 00:56:01,882
"أهل سخرٍوبحر"

657
00:56:02,471 --> 00:56:04,104
Meaning they can fight in any terrain.

658
00:56:05,951 --> 00:56:10,222
And whenever one horn is broken, another horn or grow in its place,

659
00:56:12,068 --> 00:56:15,148
and Amr Bin Aas رضي الله عنه said: They have four qualities.

660
00:56:15,173 --> 00:56:17,832
And this is in Bukhari(بخاريْ) and Muslim(مسلم). He said;

661
00:56:18,500 --> 00:56:21,027
اَنَّهُم اّسْرَ النَّاسِ اِفَاقَ بَعْدَ ضَرْبَ

