00:56:21,523 --> 00:56:24,996
They are the fastest people to wake up after they are struck.

663
00:56:26,042 --> 00:56:31,710
Take a look at Germany, for example, it built a superpower army

664
00:56:32,283 --> 00:56:34,700
and lead the world into World War One.

