Within 20 years, Germany was leading the war into World War Two.

667
00:56:41,819 --> 00:56:45,990
Within 20 years they were struck and destroyed, and within 20 years,

668
00:56:46,050 --> 00:56:47,849
they're standing on their feet and fighting again.

669
00:56:48,775 --> 00:56:49,738
So, Amr Bin Al-Aas(عَمْرُو بِن اَلْعَاص) said:

670
00:56:49,882 --> 00:56:51,601
"اَنَّهُم اّسْرَ النَّاسِ اِفَاقَ بَعْدَ ضَرْبَ"

671
00:56:51,662 --> 00:56:56,893
They are fastest, they are the fastest to wake up after they are struck.

672
00:56:58,060 --> 00:56:59,060
Number two

673
00:57:02,614 --> 00:57:09,176
اّسْرَ النَّاسِ اِفَاقَ بَعْدَ ضَرْبَ وأوشكهم كرة بعد فرة

674
00:57:09,879 --> 00:57:13,284
And they are the fastest to make a second comeback.

675
00:57:13,671 --> 00:57:16,791
So, if they attack, they would attack again soon.

676
00:57:18,760 --> 00:57:20,000
And the third one;

677
00:57:20,148 --> 00:57:25,601
وَاَكْثَرُهُم حِلْمً عِنْدَ فِتْنَةَ

678
00:57:26,377 --> 00:57:32,938
And they handle their problems with the tranquility.

679
00:57:35,586 --> 00:57:43,363
I don't know if that's right translation, they are they are able to manage chaos well,

680
00:57:44,305 --> 00:57:48,920
they can take the lead in situations of chaos,

681
00:57:50,836 --> 00:57:52,387
اشد الناس حلمًا عند الفتنة

682
00:57:52,774 --> 00:57:53,458
and then he said;

683
00:57:53,716 --> 00:57:56,790
وَاَكْثَرُهُمْ اَطْفً عَلَى لمِسْكِيْنِهِمْ وَضَعِيْفِهِمْ

684
00:57:57,615 --> 00:58:04,255
And they are the Most Merciful people and compassionate toward their weak, and poor.

685
00:58:04,731 --> 00:58:10,141
So, you'd find that Western societies tend to take care of the poor among them,

686
00:58:10,590 --> 00:58:14,597
and the needy among them, welfare system, look at the welfare system in the Western world.

