00:58:14,894 --> 00:58:16,153
It's the best on the planet,

688
00:58:18,178 --> 00:58:22,310
while another country is the poor people would die of hunger and nobody would take care of them.

689
00:58:23,845 --> 00:58:27,368
But the thing is that they focus among their own people,

690
00:58:27,393 --> 00:58:29,056
they would take care of their own needy.

