00:58:29,527 --> 00:58:32,027
It doesn't matter if 1 million people die in Iraq.

692
00:58:32,946 --> 00:58:35,617
 But if there's one poor person among us, we'll take care of them.

693
00:58:37,012 --> 00:58:37,604
And then he said;

694
00:58:37,629 --> 00:58:39,101
وخامسة حسنة جميلة

695
00:58:39,418 --> 00:58:41,476
And the fifth quality and it's a good quality,

696
00:58:42,949 --> 00:58:48,879
they do not accept oppression from their kings.

697
00:58:49,899 --> 00:58:53,018
And that is something that the western history attest to,

698
00:58:53,485 --> 00:58:56,221
they fought against the oppression of their kings,

