00:58:56,246 --> 00:59:00,233
until they achieved systems that are democratic.

700
00:59:03,611 --> 00:59:09,566
And these are characteristics that Amr Bin Al-Aas(عَمْرُو بِن اَلْعَاص) spoke about 1400 years ago.

