01:01:29,130 --> 01:01:32,003
 In one of those battles the Muslims opened the town

730
01:01:32,672 --> 01:01:35,911
and they capture the daughter of Al-Muqauqas(ألمقوقس).

731
01:01:35,935 --> 01:01:37,936
Al-Muqauqas(ألمقوقس) was the Egyptian King

732
01:01:39,490 --> 01:01:41,624
so they captured his daughter.

733
01:01:42,981 --> 01:01:47,524
Now, the rule of war in those days is, prisoners of war become your slaves.

