01:01:50,957 --> 01:01:55,767
That was the international law of the day, prisoners of war automatically become slaves.

736
01:01:56,730 --> 01:01:59,698
So, they captured the daughter of Al-Muqauqas(ألمقوقس),

737
01:02:00,276 --> 01:02:02,184
according to the norm of the day,

738
01:02:02,364 --> 01:02:06,511
she becomes a slave and she's owned by anyone of the Muslims.

